IL_00a6: ldstr "Smelting-type stations only (ones you feed ore, wood or fuel into): comma-separated prefab names of those that give blacksmithing XP when fed and get the speed bonus, infusion glow and ore save chance. Defaults: smelter = Smelter, blastfurnace = Blast Furnace, charcoal_kiln = Charcoal Kiln. The Forge and Workbench are crafting stations, not smelting ones - crafting, upgrading and repairing there always give XP and don't belong in this list. Valheim uses the same smelting code for the Windmill, Spinning Wheel and Eitr Refinery, so anything not listed here is ignored. Add a modded furnace's prefab name to include it."
